<title>MEXICO: Dina 1997 6-month net up slightly.</title>
<headline>Dina 1997 6-month net up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1997			H1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		  108.85 million	     108.14 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 3.580 bln		3.370 bln</p>
<p>	Oper Income	305.85 million	     102.58 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   80.13 million	 gain 116.39 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	  Full company name is Consorcio G Grupo Dina SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
